      "text": "Statement -&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math>&nbsp;is true; Statement -&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi></math>&nbsp;is true; Statement - <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi></math> is not a correct explanation for Statement -&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math>.",
